# PuPu UFO: the land is optional ("you may"), so choosing nothing leaves it in hand, and only a land card may be chosen (the\n# Ornithopter in hand is refused); the {3} ability counts only the Towns its
# controller controls - one here (Bot1's Adventurer's Inn), not the two Bot2 controls - so base power becomes 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
PuPu UFO
Adventurer's Inn
Adventurer's Inn
Ornithopter
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Adventurer's Inn
Adventurer's Inn
Island x18

